// Gothic set v2 (Engine 05) — refined cuirass. Torso cage (u back -> front,
// v shoulder -> waist). Anatomical profile: the breastplate swells over the
// chest (to u 1.15) and tucks under it, an angular lower edge overlaps the
// plackart, which narrows into the waist; a keel runs down the front. The
// backplate sits behind. Depth ChestGear: behind the near arm and the hair.
// Original design (not approved art). The Engine 04 file stays unchanged.
